{"parentUuid":"2658a8b0-f01a-4c99-be19-983198f1edea","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01JVRQPvmmEo6CLM7q9WnC5h","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":26143,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":584,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":26143,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":6,"output_tokens":584,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":26143,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":26143},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Caz9fEoSeAopwefyX3zWw","type":"assistant","uuid":"1c2be299-e3d0-47b8-a1d5-b35e17914cfd","timestamp":"2026-05-13T07:10:34.792Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/veerendra/farmer/yourfamilyfarmer","sessionId":"0842e1c5-7aa8-4220-bd79-9e682f0a6952","version":"2.1.140","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"1c2be299-e3d0-47b8-a1d5-b35e17914cfd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01JVRQPvmmEo6CLM7q9WnC5h","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's what to type in each field, step by step:\n\n**Step 1 — Phone number / ఫోన్ నంబర్**\n- The `+91` is already filled in (India country code). Don't change it.\n- In the box next to it, type **your own 10-digit mobile number** (the same number you used when you applied for an account).\n- Example: `9876543210`\n- ⚠️ Don't add `+91` again, don't add spaces, don't add `0` in front. Just 10 digits.\n\n**Step 2 — Activation code / యాక్టివేషన్ కోడ్**\n- Type the **activation code the owner sent you** (probably on WhatsApp or SMS).\n- It looks like `YFF-` followed by some letters/numbers.\n- Example: `YFF-K2847`\n- Type it **exactly** as you received it — capital letters, the dash `-`, everything.\n\n**Step 3 — Tap \"Activate / యాక్టివేట్ చేయండి\"**\n- This links your phone number to the account the owner created for you.\n\n**Step 4 — After activation succeeds**\n- The page will send you to the **login screen**.\n- There, enter the **same phone number** + the **password** the owner gave you (or that you set up).\n\n---\n\n**Quick checklist before tapping Activate:**\n- ✅ Phone number = your 10 digits, no `+91`, no spaces\n- ✅ Activation code = exactly as sent, including `YFF-` and the dash\n- ✅ You haven't already activated this code before (each code works once)\n\nIf it says \"invalid code,\" double-check for typos — `0` vs `O`, `1` vs `I` are the usual culprits."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":26143,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":584,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":26143,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_t